{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人「妹頭」盧頌恩近日挑戰人生首部舞台劇《辦公室劇后》，不料首場順利完成後，隨即遇上劇場界流傳的「死亡第二場」噩夢。</p><p>她在開騷前突發急性失聲，急忙打「開聲針」後仍抱恙硬撐，翌日更拍攝影片爆喊，坦言「突然失聲好驚，最怕對唔住買飛入場嘅觀眾」，徬</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:00:50.765253+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:36:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:15.088542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:15.088542+00:00","content_hash":"64e138eb47b9e082b63f83fd1e4e69fe8b113fa0ee6201912a3447b7ced74da4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}